    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/8b0103b7f0bc30996a991e65961c6b28.webp?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=48 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mecharise, players take control of a mecha on an intergalactic colonization mission. Sent to planets inhabited by hostile aliens, players must build and strengthen their bases while balancing economy, defense power, and attack power.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/162bfc1571d4dd0c7e29c9ceaf048a51.poster.avif?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/162bfc1571d4dd0c7e29c9ceaf048a51.webm?t=1754340931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/0f65f9e5716a992601edfb75066733a9.webp?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=48 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of strategy, allowing players the freedom to build and expand their bases according to their preferences. Each structure built directly influences defense capability or resource production.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/6e2d94d3898df0fa2bf817cd5c08e09b.poster.avif?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/6e2d94d3898df0fa2bf817cd5c08e09b.webm?t=1754340931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/e9b4c6c168ec965d774044e70f05cb92.webp?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=48 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, the game features tower defense elements, with waves of alien enemies attempting to attack the player's base in increasingly intense waves. Each wave brings new challenges and more powerful enemies, requiring constant adaptation of defensive and offensive strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mecha that the player controls is the centerpiece of combat. With various customization and enhancement options, players can personalize their mecha to suit different playstyles and face the unique challenges of each colonized planet.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/160e723c37379ea7be256ae078a129a8.poster.avif?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/160e723c37379ea7be256ae078a129a8.webm?t=1754340931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/6676989855f5a33987a78bed8499a64c.webp?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=48 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dynamic and challenging gameplay, Mecharise offers an engaging and strategic experience where every decision can determine success or failure in the colonization of new worlds. Get ready to face hostile aliens, defend your bases, and expand human dominance across the universe.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/7af802cdf4894d1d474fb7b44f7e01d7.poster.avif?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/7af802cdf4894d1d474fb7b44f7e01d7.webm?t=1754340931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/8b0103b7f0bc30996a991e65961c6b28.webp?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=48 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mecharise, players take control of a mecha on an intergalactic colonization mission. Sent to planets inhabited by hostile aliens, players must build and strengthen their bases while balancing economy, defense power, and attack power.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/162bfc1571d4dd0c7e29c9ceaf048a51.poster.avif?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/162bfc1571d4dd0c7e29c9ceaf048a51.webm?t=1754340931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/0f65f9e5716a992601edfb75066733a9.webp?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=48 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of strategy, allowing players the freedom to build and expand their bases according to their preferences. Each structure built directly influences defense capability or resource production.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/6e2d94d3898df0fa2bf817cd5c08e09b.poster.avif?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/6e2d94d3898df0fa2bf817cd5c08e09b.webm?t=1754340931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/e9b4c6c168ec965d774044e70f05cb92.webp?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=48 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, the game features tower defense elements, with waves of alien enemies attempting to attack the player's base in increasingly intense waves. Each wave brings new challenges and more powerful enemies, requiring constant adaptation of defensive and offensive strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mecha that the player controls is the centerpiece of combat. With various customization and enhancement options, players can personalize their mecha to suit different playstyles and face the unique challenges of each colonized planet.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/160e723c37379ea7be256ae078a129a8.poster.avif?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/160e723c37379ea7be256ae078a129a8.webm?t=1754340931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/6676989855f5a33987a78bed8499a64c.webp?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=48 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dynamic and challenging gameplay, Mecharise offers an engaging and strategic experience where every decision can determine success or failure in the colonization of new worlds. Get ready to face hostile aliens, defend your bases, and expand human dominance across the universe.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/7af802cdf4894d1d474fb7b44f7e01d7.poster.avif?t=1754340931\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887850/extras/7af802cdf4894d1d474fb7b44f7e01d7.webm?t=1754340931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
